id: pm-csv-lewj
title: Admission omits installed extension type/field registries from validation and revision lookup
description: "GH issue #214: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-csv/issues/214 · author @unbraind · created 2026-10-29T07:10:50Z · updated 2026-10-29T07:10:50Z"
